static const char _zs218_d[] = "malformed require block\n\nA unit's `require:` block declares what the unit needs from the host toolchain. It must be a unit definition, must declare at least one requirement, and every entry must be a key the compiler consumes -- today only `library:`, whose value is a compile-time string naming a link library. An unknown or misspelt key would be silently ignored, so it is rejected.";
